//RS // fields (Codegen/TIR/lower/fields.rs). The one Rust spelling of a Jet `?T`
//RS // is `JetOutcome<T, JetAbsent>`, so a raw `Option` here would hand rustc a
//RS // `.Val`/`.None` match whose arms are `Ok`/`Err` — an I2 internal compiler
//RS // error, the same one `ProcessResult.signal` produced.
